# Optimistic Scavenger, "Eerie - Whenever an enchantment you control enters and whenever you fully unlock a Room, put a +1/+1
# counter on target creature." On turn 1 Scavenger is cast, then Roaring Furnace // Steaming Sauna as its left door,
# Roaring Furnace: the Room enters, an enchantment Bot1 controls enters, and the Scavenger gets a counter (2/2). Only one door is
# unlocked, so it is not fully unlocked then. On turn 3 Bot1 unlocks Steaming Sauna as a special action (CR 709.5e): the Room is
# fully unlocked now, a second trigger, and the Scavenger is a 3/3. Casting Mox Ruby (an artifact, not an enchantment) gives
# nothing in between (checked at 2/2 after it is cast on turn 3).

